@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Smart Campus - Room Booking: Use Cases

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus System" {
    usecase "View Room Availability" as UC_View
    usecase "Book Room" as UC_Book
    usecase "Cancel Own Booking" as UC_Cancel
    usecase "Block Room" as UC_Block
    usecase "Unblock Room" as UC_Unblock
    usecase "Review Usage" as UC_Review
}

student -- UC_View
student -- UC_Book
student -- UC_Cancel
admin -- UC_Block
admin -- UC_Unblock
admin -- UC_Review

note right of UC_Book
  Rules checked inside this goal:
  R1 future start, 0 < duration <= 2h
  R2 no overlap with active bookings
  R3 blocked room rejects new booking
  Outcome: R4 successful booking
  produces a confirmation
end note

note right of UC_Cancel
  A student may cancel only
  their own bookings
end note

note as Assumptions
  Assumptions:
  A1 touching bookings (12:00 end,
  12:00 start) do NOT overlap
  A2 blocking a room does not cancel
  existing bookings, it only stops
  new ones (R3)
end note
@enduml